     "content": "\u010a\u010aFINALACTIONS:\u010aopen(grill_lid)\u010apick(raw_meat_1)\u010aplace(raw_meat_1,\u0120inside_grill)\u010aplace(raw_meat_1,\u0120plate_top)",
